#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:1
msgid "Duplicate accounts"
msgstr "重复账户"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:3
msgid ""
"The duplicate-account scan finds accounts that may belong to one person: "
"several sign-ups from one address within minutes, accounts used from one "
"address in the same hours, one browser signed in to several accounts. It "
"is for administrators of a deployment that gives each account its own "
"quota. Run it under **Users → Duplicate accounts** in the admin console, "
"or through the [admin API](#admin-api)."
msgstr ""
"重复账户扫描会找出可能属于同一个人的账户：几分钟内从同一地址注册的多个账户、在相同时段从同一地址使用的账户、在同一个浏览器中登录的多个账户。它面向为每个账户单独分配额度的部署的管理员。在管理控制台的"
" **Users → Duplicate accounts** 下运行它，或使用[管理 API](#admin-api)。"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:5
msgid ""
"The scan only reports. It changes no account, and each group it lists "
"comes with the evidence behind it, so a person can decide what, if "
"anything, to do."
msgstr "扫描只出报告。它不会改动任何账户，列出的每个分组都附有其依据，由人来决定是否采取行动、采取什么行动。"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:7
msgid "Running a scan"
msgstr "运行扫描"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:9
msgid ""
"Choose a window (the last day up to the last 90 days, 14 by default) and "
"press **Scan**. The result lists groups of accounts, highest score first."
" Each group shows its members, oldest account first, with their status, "
"role, requests in the window and sign-up date; a member's name opens the "
"account below. **Why these accounts** lists every linked pair and what "
"links it."
msgstr ""
"选择一个时间窗口（从最近一天到最近 90 天，默认 14 天），然后点击 "
"**Scan**。结果按得分从高到低列出账户分组。每个分组列出其成员，最早创建的账户在前，并显示其状态、角色、窗口内的请求数和注册日期；点击成员名称会在下方打开该账户。**Why"
" these accounts** 列出每一对相互关联的账户及其关联依据。"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:11
msgid ""
"A scan reads every request the window holds, so it runs only when you "
"ask, and a long window on a busy gateway takes longer. If it cannot "
"finish within 50 seconds, counting any wait for another scan to finish, "
"it stops and asks for a shorter window. A gateway process runs one scan "
"at a time. For half a minute after a window is scanned, asking for that "
"window again, with any `min_score` or `limit`, reuses the scan."
msgstr ""
"一次扫描会读取窗口内的全部请求，所以只在你要求时运行；在繁忙的网关上，窗口越长耗时越久。如果它无法在 50 "
"秒内完成（等待另一次扫描结束的时间也计算在内），就会停止，并提示你缩短窗口。一个网关进程同一时间只运行一次扫描。一个窗口扫描完成后的半分钟内，再次请求同一窗口，不论"
" `min_score` 或 `limit` 取何值，都会复用这次扫描。"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:13
msgid "The evidence"
msgstr "依据"

#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:15
msgid ""
"The scan links two accounts by what they share in the window. Each kind "
"of evidence has a weight:"
msgstr "扫描根据两个账户在窗口内的共同点把它们关联起来。每种依据都有一个权重："

