#: ../developer/duplicate-accounts.md:72
msgid ""
"The response has `accounts_scanned` (the accounts active in the window, "
"the operator's own aside), `shared_addresses` and `shared_browsers` (how "
"many were set aside as shared), `total_groups`, `groups` and `oversized`."
" Each group has its `score`, `user_ids`, `signals` (the kinds of evidence"
" found, strongest first), `address_only`, `members` and `links`. Each "
"link names two accounts and lists its `evidence`: the `kind`, its "
"`weight`, the `addresses` it was seen on (empty for identity and "
"behaviour evidence) and a one-sentence `detail`. A scan that runs out of "
"time is answered with 504."
msgstr ""
"响应包含 `accounts_scanned`（窗口内活跃的账户数，不含运营方自己的账户）、`shared_addresses` 和 "
"`shared_browsers`（因共享而被搁置的数量）、`total_groups`、`groups` 以及 "
"`oversized`。每个分组包含 "
"`score`、`user_ids`、`signals`（发现的依据种类，最强的在前）、`address_only`、`members` 和 "
"`links`。每条关联指明两个账户，并列出其 `evidence`：`kind`、`weight`、出现过该依据的 "
"`addresses`（身份类和行为类依据为空），以及一句话的 `detail`。超时的扫描会返回 504。"
